            "text": "𝟏 𝐖𝐞𝐞𝐤 𝐭𝐨 𝐆𝐨! \nToday’s media briefing set the tone for @gitexaikazakhstan the Region’s most empowering tech, startup and digital investment event - as Central Asia prepares to welcome global technology leaders, investors, and policymakers to Almaty.\n\nThis is where sovereign AI ambitions translate into real-world deployment.\n\nKazakhstan is advancing at pace — from GPU superclusters 𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐤𝐞𝐝 𝐚𝐦𝐨𝐧𝐠 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐰𝐨𝐫𝐥𝐝’𝐬 𝐭𝐨𝐩 𝟏𝟎𝟎, to a national AI law, and hyperscale data centre expansion set to reach 𝟐𝟎,𝟎𝟎𝟎 𝐫𝐚𝐜𝐤𝐬 𝐛𝐲 𝟐𝟎𝟑𝟎.\n\nAt the centre of this momentum are the leaders shaping the region’s trajectory:\n@bakhtiyar_mukhametkaliyev Abdurakhman Mukhametkaliyev Vice Minister of Ministry of Artificial Intelligence and Digital Development of the Republic of Kazakhstan, Republic of Kazakhstan \nOlzhas Smagulov, Deputy @akimat_almaty of Almaty City\n@daniyaakhmetova CEO Digital Bridge, @astana.hub \n@murat.abdrakhmanov Abdrakhmanov, Founder of @ma7.vc\nKiyan Z., CIO and Partner, Sturgeon Capital\n@bilal.alrais , Vice President, Portfolio Growth Tech & Digital, inD\n\nTogether with global technology leaders including @cisco , @googlecloud @huawei , @dell , and @salesforce - and investors from 28 countries managing over $200 billion in assets - the event will drive high-impact partnerships across infrastructure, investment, and innovation.\n\nWith more than 300 companies, 100+ startups, and participation from over 60 countries, Almaty becomes the focal point for Central Asia’s next phase of digital growth.\n\nGet Your Visitor Pass - Link in bio\n\nGet 50% Conference Pass: Link in bio \nLimited time only\n\n#GITEXAIKazakhstan #AI #GitexUniverse #IntelligenceEconomy #CentralAsia AstanaHub\n\n1 неделя до старта GITEX AI KAZAKHSTAN.\n\n Сегодняшний медиа-брифинг подтвердил: Алматы станет точкой притяжения глобальных технологических лидеров, инвесторов и представителей власти.\n\n Здесь амбиции в области суверенного ИИ переходят в практическую реализацию — от GPU-суперк